      "text_preview": "Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/170406381/\n8\n\n C/W Wp No. 12686 of 2023\n Wp No. 12712 of 2023\n And 10 Others\n Hosakote,\n Bengaluru 562 114.\n ...Petitioner\n(By Sri. Vasudevan H.N., Advocate)\nAnd:\n G.S. Jayaswamy\n The Insecticide "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d5258027adc44e4e966a90d88782b5b0_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. The afore-narrated facts, dates, link in the chain of events are all a matter of record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "feea90253d0e4657acd20b9b4ce41622_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Proprietorship concern of the petitioner is admittedly in the business of sale and distribution of insecticides, vegetable seeds and other agriculture related products."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1cdecc7e8edc4d46a87b509e41e0ba7d_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent conducted inspection of the shop of the petitioner on four different dates as noted hereinabove and collects samples."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cc60adf376d64363a49ced2db9922640_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "All those samples were of various bioproducts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6fda74261c7b45e3b7616d13f8ef9c79_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The three samples that were drawn from the sealed containers of the petitioner premises were sent to a laboratory at the University of Agricultural Sciences, Raichur for their analysis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fc4d3307ec364fdc8f4add013f07fd8e_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Laboratory confirmed presence of traces of certain chemicals."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "78a6eb5672d340b6964097b5a58f7d8f_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n- 20 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS The petitioner then in all these cases requests the respondent to send the samples to the Central Insecticides Laboratory for re-examination within 28 days of receipt of report as necessary in law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "160e4163d6404797b991a03d622cbd09_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This request does not spring from air but has a statutory backing."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8323e8c77d8742f6ac7057859ae78d04_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Sections 16, 36 and 37 of the Act deals and defines Central Insecticides Laboratory, power of Central Government to make rules and power of the State Government to make rules, respectively."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3ae7bddb47a544f7b92d2c6ca10c7408_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They read as follows:\n\"16."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb8949a066fb40e6ac609e85812267af_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Central Insecticides Laboratory.--The Central Government may, by notification in the Official Gazette, establish a Central Insecticides Laboratory under the control of a Director to be appointed by the Central Government to carry out the fu"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a554b51f7bcc49e2b44c5f8a41994ce7_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Provided that consultation with the Board may be dispensed with if the Central Government is of opinion that circumstances have arisen which render it necessary - 21 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS to make rules without such consultation"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1f99b512392c40bd98cd6a533f0a4f84_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(2) In particular and without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing power, such rules may prescribe-- (a) the method of packing and labelling;\n(b) the manner of registration of an insecticide;"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bc148416fb014b4c9eeb1ae0d0d50556_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "( 3 ) Every rule made by the Central Government under this Act shall be laid, as soon as may be after it is made, before each House of Parliament while it is in session for a total period of thirty days which may be comprised in one session"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e2335297812545e58a842f94f25895b9_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n\"37. Power of the State Governments to make rules.--(1) The State Government may,\nafter consultation with the board and subject to the condition of previous publication,\nby notification in the Official Gazette, make rules for the purpose o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6eea9556123e4e51bf872a0bef3b29a6_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(3) Every rule made by the State Government under this Act shall be laid, as soon as may be after it is made, before the State Legislature.\"\n(Emphasis supplied) The Government of India by a notification would establish a Central Insecticid"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "09f10588ff3c4160a7c7519540030fd8_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Government of India in terms of Section 16 of the Act has notified the Central Insecticides Laboratory, to be at Hyderabad."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d32e43051bf34139952e3bc4b73fa5a5_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Rules are promulgated by the Central Government invoking Section 36 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c3b432cfaa44db297aad4c2908a9c13_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nB S Suresh Babu vs Pramod Kumar H R on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/170406381/\n18"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e31fec520a294a448ae3d91d555a6dbb_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 37 of the Act also empowers the State Government to make Rules to carry out the functions under the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "72d23d67189d43109b8364ce9b83e5bd_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. The Government of India in terms of Section 36 of the Act has notified the Rules."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6091177d5d484efc81b6cb75f553aa7c_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Rule 5 which deals with functions of the laboratory reads as follows:-\n\"5. Functions of Laboratory.--The functions of the Laboratory shall be as follows-- (a) to analyse such samples of insecticides sent to it under the Act by any officer o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bca3b42edcd34155b1351a7d26de7086_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Laboratory is defined under Rule 2(e)\nwhich would mean a Central insecticides Laboratory.\n12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3e013dbe3168462d88624ffc09a0dc41_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The issue now would be the place of analysis of the samples that were drawn from the business premises of the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3ef29dedb11b440e939c638806e017a8_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is admittedly a bio-pesticide and not an insecticide."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f6f4115900f94e30bdcb6de99cc5dbdf_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For Bio-pesticides and Insecticides analysis is completely different."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff10bde3c42c408abf4d4eaebb77c299_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Government of India in exercise of powers conferred under Section 16 (supra) r/w Rule 5 which - 26 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS deals with Central Insecticides Laboratory and the functions of the said laboratory has notified the C"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "69261fb0f88d49caaeae663ea7fe3a9c_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The notification reads as follows:\nB S Suresh Babu vs Pramod Kumar H R on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/170406381/\n19 \"MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE (Department of Agriculture and Cooperation)\nNOTIFICATION New Delh"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5c234bc37cae4d79a7ec3a8a677b9287_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "- In exercise of the powers conferred by proviso to Section 16 of the Insecticides Act, 1968 (46 of 1968),\nread with rule 5 of the Insecticides Rules 1971, the Central Government hereby directs that the following functions of the Central In"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9f2beeee016c465db921087aadbcb707_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(Emphasis supplied)"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c14ba185fc3f4cb5aa1fdccadf868675_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The notification is clear that the functions of the said institute is to analyse bio-pesticides sent to it."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d6c47edda62f4aefaa4a5fb7e391c495_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "What is seized from the shop of the petitioner is not an insecticide, but a bio- pesticide."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a78f790f9854205baf15b4843fb8ca4_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The learned Additional State Public Prosecutor has strenuously contended that the State has notified a laboratory under Section 19 of the Act and in terms of powers conferred upon it under Section 37 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aceb69b77ba843aebc4ed276ad8d78eb_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The notification of the State Government reads as follows:\n\"GOVERNMENT OF KARNATAKA No.AGD/35/ACT/2018 Karnataka Government Secretariat, M.S. Building, Bangalore, Dated 20-03-2019."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "96879724138c4827a9b3c80437d0943c_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "NOTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f867366ab324276a521ec9bfb559a35_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In exercise of the powers conferred by the Section 19 of the Insecticides Act, 1968 (Central Act 46 of 1968) read with Rule 23 of the Insecticides Rules, 1971, the Government of Karnataka hereby notify the labs specified in column (2) to an"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5db455aa014042fb884bef106628c4d9_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Pesticide Assistant Whole Residue Director of State of Analysis Agriculture Karnataka Laboratory, and Banashankari Agriculture Bengaluru Officer 2. Pesticide Professor and Whole Residue and Head State of Food Quality (Agricultural Karnataka"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b39ae537422f4070836163c50229e6a5_82",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Assistant Professor (Agricultural Microbiology) By order and in the Governor of Karnataka (B.S.NAGARATHNAMMA) Under Secretary to Government, Agriculture Department (Planning)\"\n(Emphasis supplied)"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e39a9629c570486f98a787bed4d375f1_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The notification admittedly springs from the power conferred under Section 19 of the Act r/w Rule 23 of the Rules."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c718f84c75dd4fa893374ba5ccdd1b73_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, it becomes necessary to notice Section 19 of the Act and Rule 23 of the Rules."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b202a4054eb6497cb716df2673ef4b70_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 19 reads as follows:\n- 29 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS \"19. Insecticide Analysts.--The"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8bda2772b05d4dfebd332d45913b21b7_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Central"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "900dec16f9c245788bf3894e76dfad13_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "or a State Government"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "84458100f0e34adbae042cbf9b961ba1_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "may, by notification in the Official Gazette, appoint persons in such number as it thinks fit and possessing such technical and other qualifications as may be prescribed to be Insecticide Analysts for such areas and in respect of such insec"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0ac2ea09dd1443258fd1bf12e1b05a6b_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSection 19 of the Act deals with Insecticide Analysts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a67790d515984db290f8a68b21e030be_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It empowers the Central Government or the State Government by a notification to appoint persons in such number to become analysts in respect of insecticides or class of insecticides as may be specified in the notification."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4d2fbb5132d840e1a4de20d36e8cc3ec_91",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Rule 23 of the Rules reads as follows:\n\"23. Duties of Insecticide Analyst.--(1) The Insecticide Analyst shall analyse or cause to be analysed or test or cause to be tested such samples of Insecticides as may be sent to him by the Insecticid"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e3e9b9f0b61d477f9646fb0aca35ca67_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Rule 23 deals with duties of Insecticide Analyst."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "871f78cdea404d9386440fc2c35a0409_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is reporting of analytical work that is sent for reporting."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb674f19c8c24f0585456df369e2dae8_94",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is ununderstandable as to how the said provisions are pressed B S Suresh Babu vs Pramod Kumar H R on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/170406381/\n21 - 30 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS into service with re"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d9b654f3ecf14370a248ec453635749e_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the notification (supra) of the State Government dated 20.03.2019 refers to bio-pesticides, it cannot take precedence over the notification issued by the Government of India under Section 16 of the Act,\nquoted (supra)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a7228bb5def142a4bdf207f4e01146e6_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 16 of the Act makes the laboratory at Hyderabad, the only institute for the purpose of testing bio-pesticides."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e7d17e4343db4230a51a87b38249e964_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The learned Additional State Public Prosecutor also refers to a government order of the State to buttress his submission with regard to reference to a particular laboratory."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "03abced1f18a403d8e65e1d6d3cd4d36_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said government order also leads the State nowhere."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0d61630ce2b14904a44cf37412a4ef42_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "What is referred to as the laboratory in the government order is to test \"QlP\", which is an insecticide and the sample that is drawn from the business premises of the petitioner is admittedly, not an insecticide but it is a bio- pesticide, "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c84dfc5c6c2e45169ac21de72da63b41_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The marked difference between the two is completely ignored by the State Government while issuing the notification or the government order as the case would be."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "165c1eecf332431f8519231be367bc43_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n- 31 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS 13."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e90c189b4ed1441d81ff3cf64e349013_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Central Government having issued a notification under Section 16 of the Act qua bio-pesticide, the same cannot be overridden by the State by creating another alternate to the laboratory constituted by Government of India particularly in"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3a1bbc7897b45b59b036de0cbe0780f_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If this is the statutory frame work, certain admitted facts are to be noticed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f47590340cba40ffab90d04dbc48680e_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The samples are drawn - two samples are sent to Banashankari for residual analysis and one to the Institute at Raichur, both of which find place in the notification dated 20.03.2019 (supra)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0e85ee199f564003b333af92683ac52c_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Both of which do not have jurisdiction in terms of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "642f3c9c62d848d6a56f549779b6176e_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The jurisdiction to test bio-pesticides lie with the National Institute of Plant Health Management, Hyderabad in terms of the notification issued by the Government of India."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "51af5d277a0446c18eb3986e9a1adcc3_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, the samples sent to a laboratory, other than the one constituted under the Act, has vitiated the entire proceedings."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ee774e9a1f6d42d8b996f873fdd178ca_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n14. Today, to send the samples to the appropriate laboratory as observed hereinabove, i.e., the laboratory at Hyderabad, is of no avail as the samples have reached their expiry date."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "12e9387f186044d4b743b8ed55ae38ca_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nthere cannot be testing of the samples that have already lost their efficacy."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aeb95f9981034ea495493a936b5054e8_110",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This Court would not issue - 32 - NC: 2024:KHC:51578 AND 10 OTHERS futile rights."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3e301e143b054ffe958fee979f5257d0_111",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, henceforth, seizure of bio-pesticide should also be got tested at the laboratory, at Hyderabad, as is observed hereinabove, to bring it in tune with the law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ea6369c0a2ab4fcdbda6c117ae8358ac_113",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(i) Writ Petitions are allowed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3bee3d2af7b9419c9105b8098cfa2f22_114",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
          "matched_text": "quashed",
          "start": 106,
          "end": 113
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "(ii) Proceedings in C.C.No.4701 of 2023 pending before the Principal Civil Judge and JMFC, Hosakote stand quashed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "12cb8b64c04743ee8e88325cb4b41dc9_115",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iii) It is always open to the competent authorities to carryout out the purposes of the Act in a manner known to law as is observed in the course of the order."
    }
